# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Updates of tunable parameters (D213) on the GPU: leapfrog
# keeps its positions and velocities through an update; NPT updated before
# its first run equals a compile with the new values to the bit, the
# barostat taking the constants of the new values.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide integrators GPU Double | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide integrators GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU {{Double|Mixed}}: leapfrog keeps its positions and velocities through an update
# CHECK: GPU {{Double|Mixed}}: NPT, an update before the first run equals a compile with the new values to the bit
# CHECK: integrators passed
